{"api_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/36008","collected_at":"2026-09-27T21:56:41.804806+00:00","comments":[{"author_association":"MEMBER","body":"@hawkinsp please help review / route ...Thank you ","created_at":"2026-05-08T16:16:31Z","html_url":"https://github.com/jax-ml/jax/issues/36008#issuecomment-4407955312","id":4407955312,"issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/36008","minimized":null,"node_id":"IC_kwDOCTkjjc8AAAABBrwPcA","performed_via_github_app":null,"pin":null,"reactions":{"+1":0,"-1":0,"confused":0,"eyes":0,"heart":0,"hooray":0,"laugh":0,"rocket":0,"total_count":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/comments/4407955312/reactions"},"updated_at":"2026-05-08T16:16:31Z","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/comments/4407955312","user":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7131192?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjsML/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjsML/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjsML/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjsML/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mjsML","id":7131192,"login":"mjsML","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxMzExOTI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjsML/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjsML/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjsML/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjsML/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjsML/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjsML","user_view_type":"public"}}],"issue":{"active_lock_reason":null,"assignee":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/25362393?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cjkkkk/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cjkkkk/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cjkkkk/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cjkkkk/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Cjkkkk","id":25362393,"login":"Cjkkkk","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI1MzYyMzkz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cjkkkk/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cjkkkk/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cjkkkk/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cjkkkk/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cjkkkk/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cjkkkk","user_view_type":"public"},"assignees":[{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/25362393?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cjkkkk/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cjkkkk/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cjkkkk/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cjkkkk/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Cjkkkk","id":25362393,"login":"Cjkkkk","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI1MzYyMzkz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cjkkkk/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cjkkkk/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cjkkkk/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cjkkkk/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cjkkkk/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cjkkkk","user_view_type":"public"}],"author_association":"NONE","body":"### Description\n\n### Description\n\nWhen using jax.nn.dot_product_attention with implementation=\"cudnn\" inside a jax.shard_map body, the backward pass (VJP) produces gradient arrays that are missing the manual sharding axis annotations (\n{V:(dp,tp)}), causing a ValueError at the custom_vjp boundary.\n\nThe XLA implementation (implementation=\"xla\") works correctly in the same context.\n\n### Reproduction\n```\nimport jax\nimport jax.numpy as jnp\nfrom jax.sharding import PartitionSpec, NamedSharding, Mesh\nimport functools\nimport numpy as np\n\ndevices = np.array(jax.devices()[:8]).reshape(2, 4)\nmesh = Mesh(devices, axis_names=(\"dp\", \"tp\"))\n\n@functools.partial(\n    jax.shard_map,\n    mesh=mesh,\n    in_specs=PartitionSpec(\"dp\", None, \"tp\", None),\n    out_specs=PartitionSpec(\"dp\", None, \"tp\", None),\n)\ndef attn_fn(qkv):\n    q, k, v = jnp.split(qkv, 3, axis=-1)\n    # Fails with implementation=\"cudnn\", works with implementation=\"xla\"\n    return jax.nn.dot_product_attention(q, k, v, is_causal=True, implementation=\"cudnn\")\n\ndef loss_fn(qkv):\n    return attn_fn(qkv).sum()\n\nkey = jax.random.PRNGKey(0)\nqkv = jax.random.normal(key, (4, 8192, 4, 384), dtype=jnp.bfloat16)\nqkv = jax.device_put(qkv, NamedSharding(mesh, PartitionSpec(\"dp\", None, \"tp\", None)))\n\n# This raises ValueError\ngrads = jax.grad(loss_fn)(qkv)\n```\n\n### Error\n```\nTraceback (most recent call last):\n  File \"<stdin>\", line 1, in <module>\n  File \"<stdin>\", line 2, in loss_fn\n  File \"<stdin>\", line 10, in attn_fn\n  File \"/usr/local/lib/python3.12/dist-packages/jax/_src/nn/functions.py\", line 1223, in dot_product_attention\n    out = cudnn_dot_product_attention(\n  File \"/usr/local/lib/python3.12/dist-packages/jax/_src/cudnn/fused_attention_stablehlo.py\", line 2059, in dot_product_attention\n    output = _dot_product_attention(\njax._src.source_info_util.JaxStackTraceBeforeTransformation: ValueError: Custom VJP bwd rule must produce an output with the same type as the args tuple of the primal function, but at output[0] the bwd rule produced an output of type bfloat16[2,8192,1,128] corresponding to an input of type bfloat16[2,8192,1,128]{V:(dp,tp)}, so the varying manual axes do not match\n```\n\n### Root Cause\n\nThe custom partitioning rules for the cudnn fused attention backward primitive in jax/_src/cudnn/fused_attention_stablehlo.py (specifically _dot_product_attention_bwd_infer_sharding_from_operands and \nthe Shardy rule _bwd_shardy_rule) do not propagate manual sharding axes from the forward inputs to the backward gradient outputs.\n\nThe forward primitive's sharding inference correctly handles the axes, but the backward primitive produces outputs without the {V:(dp,tp)} annotation, causing the type mismatch at the custom_vjp \nboundary.\n\n### Environment\n\n- JAX version: 0.9.0\n- Platform: CUDA (GPU)\n- Shardy partitioner: enabled (default in 0.9.0); also reproduces with jax_use_shardy_partitioner=False\n\n### System info (python version, jaxlib version, accelerator, etc.)\n\n```\n>>> import jax; jax.print_environment_info()\njax:    0.9.0\njaxlib: 0.9.0\nnumpy:  2.2.6\npython: 3.12.3 (main, Jun 18 2025, 17:59:45) [GCC 13.3.0]\ndevice info: NVIDIA H100 80GB HBM3-8, 8 local devices\"\nprocess_count: 1\nplatform: uname_result(system='Linux', node='shentang-job-2ryk-worker-0', release='5.10.237-230.948.amzn2.x86_64', version='#1 SMP Tue May 27 13:53:05 UTC 2025', machine='x86_64')\nXLA_FLAGS= --xla_gpu_enable_latency_hiding_scheduler=true\n\n$ nvidia-smi\nWed Mar 18 17:01:48 2026       \n+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+\n| NVIDIA-SMI 550.163.01             Driver Version: 550.163.01     CUDA Version: 12.9     |\n|-----------------------------------------+------------------------+----------------------+\n| GPU  Name                 Persistence-M | Bus-Id          Disp.A | Volatile Uncorr. ECC |\n| Fan  Temp   Perf          Pwr:Usage/Cap |           Memory-Usage | GPU-Util  Compute M. |\n|                                         |                        |               MIG M. |\n|=========================================+========================+======================|\n|   0  NVIDIA H100 80GB HBM3          On  |   00000000:53:00.0 Off |                    0 |\n| N/A   28C    P0            113W /  700W |   62184MiB /  81559MiB |      0%      Default |\n|                                         |                        |             Disabled |\n+-----------------------------------------+------------------------+----------------------+\n|   1  NVIDIA H100 80GB HBM3          On  |   00000000:64:00.0 Off |                    0 |\n| N/A   29C    P0            114W /  700W |   62182MiB /  81559MiB |      0%      Default |\n|                                         |                        |             Disabled |\n+-----------------------------------------+------------------------+----------------------+\n|   2  NVIDIA H100 80GB HBM3          On  |   00000000:75:00.0 Off |                    0 |\n| N/A   27C    P0            113W /  700W |   62182MiB /  81559MiB |      0%      Default |\n|                                         |                        |             Disabled |\n+-----------------------------------------+------------------------+----------------------+\n|   3  NVIDIA H100 80GB HBM3          On  |   00000000:86:00.0 Off |                    0 |\n| N/A   32C    P0            115W /  700W |   62182MiB /  81559MiB |      0%      Default |\n|                                         |                        |             Disabled |\n+-----------------------------------------+------------------------+----------------------+\n|   4  NVIDIA H100 80GB HBM3          On  |   00000000:97:00.0 Off |                    0 |\n| N/A   31C    P0            114W /  700W |   62182MiB /  81559MiB |      0%      Default |\n|                                         |                        |             Disabled |\n+-----------------------------------------+------------------------+----------------------+\n|   5  NVIDIA H100 80GB HBM3          On  |   00000000:A8:00.0 Off |                    0 |\n| N/A   27C    P0            115W /  700W |   62182MiB /  81559MiB |      0%      Default |\n|                                         |                        |             Disabled |\n+-----------------------------------------+------------------------+----------------------+\n|   6  NVIDIA H100 80GB HBM3          On  |   00000000:B9:00.0 Off |                    0 |\n| N/A   30C    P0            117W /  700W |   62182MiB /  81559MiB |      0%      Default |\n|                                         |                        |             Disabled |\n+-----------------------------------------+------------------------+----------------------+\n|   7  NVIDIA H100 80GB HBM3          On  |   00000000:CA:00.0 Off |                    0 |\n| N/A   29C    P0            114W /  700W |   62182MiB /  81559MiB |      0%      Default |\n|                                         |                        |             Disabled |\n+-----------------------------------------+------------------------+----------------------+\n                                                                                         \n+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+\n| Processes:                                                                              |\n|  GPU   GI   CI        PID   Type   Process name                              GPU Memory |\n|        ID   ID                                                               Usage      |\n|=========================================================================================|\n|    0   N/A  N/A       313      C   python                                          0MiB |\n|    1   N/A  N/A       313      C   python                                          0MiB |\n|    2   N/A  N/A       313      C   python                                          0MiB |\n|    3   N/A  N/A       313      C   python                                          0MiB |\n|    4   N/A  N/A       313      C   python                                          0MiB |\n|    5   N/A  N/A       313      C   python                                          0MiB |\n|    6   N/A  N/A       313      C   pyt